      "value": "I would add this just being a overall accessibility thing. Some people that can't see as well or are partial blind will overall make it harder for legibility for nameplates. \n\nI have also noticed that overall there have been slight hiccups with frame rate not just on open beta but even on main build is overall a lot more lag with the nameplates. I don't know for sure if that is just when you get a lot in one room but something to look into since it could affect lower-end devices a lot more since most folks don't have a super crazy good device for VRChat",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
